# kbot (02 §9 and §13.1; owner decision of 16 Nov 2026: the firewall of the Oracle image,
# not ufw). The image leaves IPv6 open; the instance has no public IPv6 address, but this
# closes it as a second barrier: only the loopback, replies to connections the server
# opened, and ICMPv6 (neighbour discovery needs it). Outgoing traffic is not restricted.
*filter
:INPUT DROP [0:0]
:FORWARD DROP [0:0]
:OUTPUT ACCEPT [0:0]
-A INPUT -i lo -j ACCEPT
-A INPUT -m state --state RELATED,ESTABLISHED -j ACCEPT
-A INPUT -p ipv6-icmp -j ACCEPT
COMMIT
